--- !u!114 &2057481846
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 2057481843}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 7d20f73aabcb4cfbaac49363662be3e1, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  currentDialogueIndex: 0
  textStartOffset: 0
  dialogues:
  - texts:
    - The purple bits are delicious, soloso! I lap them up wherever I go.
    - Say... you look quick and nimble. Unlike myself.
    - If you find fresh purple bits where I can't reach, won't you bring them to
      me?
    advanceDialogueIndex: 1
  - texts:
    - I am Indritzi. Soloso.
    - Maybe you know of my aromatic products? They are famously pungent.
    - Resins, herbs. Musks and gunks. I procure them all, and mine are the best!
    - I've recently come by a special botanical. Bring me purple bits, and we can
      share!
    advanceDialogueIndex: 1
  - texts:
    - My stalks sensed something emanating deep within this cave.
    - Whatever it is, I have no mind for it, soloso!
    - Purple bits are my only care!
    advanceDialogueIndex: 1
  - texts:
    - I will be waiting here for you to serve me purple bits.
    - Is 500 purple bits so much to ask?
    advanceDialogueIndex: 1
  - texts:
    - I will be waiting here for you to serve me purple bits.
    - Is 500 purple bits so much to ask?
    advanceDialogueIndex: 0
  - texts:
    - Oh?
    - I can taste it on you! Purple bits!
    - Don't be greedy, now. Let's exchange...
    - Ooh, ooh! My stalks are quivering! My radula is rearing!
    - Thank you, biped!
    - Now, as I promised... I hope you are ready for my special scent!
    advanceDialogueIndex: 0
  - texts:
    - Ah, my friend! You have returned!
    - Can't get enough of my special scents, can you? They can be quite addictive...
    - Anything for you, soloso! I have plenty to go around!
    advanceDialogueIndex: 0
  DialogueName: Indritzi
  LookAtOverride: {fileID: 671547992}
  CameraY: 0.7
